            {
              "text": "Sa'i is seven legs between two hills",
              "size": "hook",
              "at": 0.0,
              "until": 3.61
            },
            {
              "text": "Safa and Marwah, the tenth of Dhul Hijjah",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 3.95,
              "until": 7.94
            },
            {
              "text": "At Safa, begin with what Allah began with",
              "sub": "Safa and Marwah are among Allah's symbols",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 8.28,
              "until": 15.42
            },
            {
              "text": "Walk to Marwah: that first leg is one",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 15.76,
              "until": 19.49
            },
            {
              "text": "Seven legs end you at Marwah, not Safa",
              "sub": "between the green markers, men jog, a sunnah",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 19.83,
              "until": 27.02
            },
            {
              "text": "Sa'i remembers Hajar, alone with an infant",
              "sub": "seven times, alone, looking for help",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 27.36,
              "until": 34.14
            },
            {
              "text": "Maliki, Shafi'i, Hanbali: sa'i is a pillar",
              "sub": "Hanafis: a duty, a sacrifice repairs it",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 34.48,
              "until": 41.51
            },
            {
              "text": "Sa'i is the memory of a woman running",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 41.85,
              "until": 45.58
            },
            {
              "eyebrow": "Sa'i, Safa to Marwah",
              "text": "No one walks this Hajj without her path",
